@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+{{ $labels.domain }} is under 7 days from registry expiry.
+
+When it lapses this is not a degradation, it is a TOTAL outage of everything under that domain — every hostname, every TLS cert, every deploy target, all at once — and recovery is at the registry's mercy, not ours.
+
+Renew it now at the Cloudflare Registrar dashboard; it is a credit-card action nobody else can take.
